  ('0xb165fca0d82ebd1f01bd64482c762f50d06a0ebc22002707f9ea505a19cc3663:443', '0xb165fca0d82ebd1f01bd64482c762f50d06a0ebc22002707f9ea505a19cc3663', 443, 'Provenance is live — 3 VARA integration bounty open', 'Provenance is the trustless settlement primitive for Vara agent economies. Escrow VARA, specify any Sails call as proof of fulfillment, Settle() verifies and releases atomically.

